      "watchText": "Coastal cargo watch\n\nCivilian watch-house guards handle coastal cargo demands. Recruited company soldiers, walls and towers handle physical enemies on the island; their orders do not add watch readiness.\n\nCommand soldiers in Company\n\nQuiet water. A chance to prepare.\n\nThe next cargo warning can begin in 6m 34s at 1\u00d7. Keep a reserve of food and building supplies, or establish a standing watch.\n\nHow to prepare a coastal patrol\nStaff the coastal watch\n\nGuards leave other jobs to protect coastal cargo and provide escorts.\n\n\u2161 Time paused \u00b7 work waits\nResume time\n3 guards assigned \u00b7 3 requested\nWatch house \u00b7 level 2\n\u2212\n3\n+\n\nOn the watch: Bram 2, Cora 2, Dev 2\n\n2.1 food/min for watch supplies \u00b7 2.7 at full staffing\n\n3/4 workers\n\nGive guards priority\nView watch house\n0 guards assigned \u00b7 0 requested\nWatch house \u00b7 level 2\n\u2212\n0\n+\n\nNo residents assigned here.\n\n0 food/min for watch supplies \u00b7 2.7 at full staffing\n\nNo workers requested\n\nGive guards priority\nView watch house\n0 guards assigned \u00b7 0 requested\nWatch house \u00b7 level 2\n\u2212\n0\n+\n\nNo residents assigned here.\n\n0 food/min for watch supplies \u00b7 2.7 at full staffing\n\nNo workers requested\n\nGive guards priority\nView watch house\n0 guards assigned \u00b7 0 requested\nWatch house \u00b7 level 2\n\u2212\n0\n+\n\nNo residents assigned here.\n\n0 food/min for watch supplies \u00b7 2.7 at full staffing\n\nNo workers requested\n\nGive guards priority\nView watch house\nCoastal record \u00b7 5 defenses \u00b7 4 paid \u00b7 0 raids",
